{"steam_appid":2491490,"steam_name":"Pit Panic","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2491490/167908793/06fec5a788cce360b97f28d5de687a303829c3a5/1784664319/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784665069","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257381952/182bace12034b365ba2771eb739bd856f524f226/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784665069","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/66fd9f1f1093c829c4ea7fd51b92dadb466c4263/ss_66fd9f1f1093c829c4ea7fd51b92dadb466c4263.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114003","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/7db6edcf01d42fb27c93fe568ed93996462133e3/ss_7db6edcf01d42fb27c93fe568ed93996462133e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114003","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/3887e8234acd09aa22526efa82aa12af3e9f8488/ss_3887e8234acd09aa22526efa82aa12af3e9f8488.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114003","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/b345f0d84ca280f94416dd6052cbec4a15d154f1/ss_b345f0d84ca280f94416dd6052cbec4a15d154f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114003","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/27d2379b169a20fff932f143915c8f45f7b6401c/ss_27d2379b169a20fff932f143915c8f45f7b6401c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114003"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pit Panic is a challenging rogue-like 2D platformer with fast pace, unique gameplay and environmental puzzles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take on the role of a curious archeologist and race through handcrafted levels, take down ancient bosses and jump up like your pants are on fire.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET HOOKED!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the mysterious hook – a powerful omnitool – that digs through blocks, swings you around and unlocks hidden treasures. Master physics-driven movement to avoid deadly traps and blast through interactive blocks. Turn sand into glass, jelly into fire and bridges into weapons, if necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/c8324a414e58a32e56e8f96584033837.poster.avif?t=1786114003\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/c8324a414e58a32e56e8f96584033837.webm?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/c8324a414e58a32e56e8f96584033837.mp4?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THINK FAST, RUN FASTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to dig deep to return to the surface. There are many ways to die, but only one way to survive: up. Get in the flow, make split-second decisions and even sacrifice your health for power-ups to escape the crumbling Aztec temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/ded9583e5cf875359ea517546e204f5e.poster.avif?t=1786114003\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/ded9583e5cf875359ea517546e204f5e.webm?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/ded9583e5cf875359ea517546e204f5e.mp4?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY RUN IS DIFFERENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover four distinct biomes, each with unique puzzles, enemies and art styles. Over 1,000 unique handcrafted levels mix things up every time you play. Or build your own levels to put fellow adventurers to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/5c85be2fe3d13447f1bb1e502faba1f7.poster.avif?t=1786114003\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/5c85be2fe3d13447f1bb1e502faba1f7.webm?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/5c85be2fe3d13447f1bb1e502faba1f7.mp4?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE OTHER PLAYERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real fun starts after you climb out of the pit. Compare your skills with other players, beat their best times and complete unique daily challenges to receive precious rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/4299647fe3ff4f2bbed0812bccd9cc0b.poster.avif?t=1786114003\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/4299647fe3ff4f2bbed0812bccd9cc0b.webm?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491490/extras/4299647fe3ff4f2bbed0812bccd9cc0b.mp4?t=1786114003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 / Radeon RX 570 / Intel Arc A380 (6 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060 / Radeon RX 6700 / Intel Arc A750 (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Flying Rat Studio"],"publishers":["Flying Rat Studio"],"release_date":"Jul 21, 2026"}